  "title": "[Music Room] Mystic Star: Town Theme",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "title",
      "source": "【音楽室】Mystic Star：町曲",
      "sourceHash": "9dd00b0118103cb1e49d1927722803ee19724354ccc178a6955e777c1da9b915",
      "translation": "[Music Room] Mystic Star: Town Theme",
      "contextHash": "9dd00b0118103cb1e49d1927722803ee19724354ccc178a6955e777c1da9b915"
    },
    {
      "id": "link-001",
      "type": "link",
      "source": "NR_town6.mp3（☆☆☆☆☆）",
      "sourceHash": "a05cc7418f61d6d45049fbb3cf5f403122719993a4abb933a90eb8b7e7dcc3de",
      "translation": "NR_town6.mp3 (☆☆☆☆☆) ",
      "contextHash": "c28b085aa166dad04aedac68f53cc02939153030bf509a0f0b2b727d9b2ff0cf"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-001",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "平和な町。",
      "sourceHash": "f90441fe85fe676849a235e4db7e0af6f116b7cc763b6455c4609c54f5bcba2e",
      "translation": "A peaceful town.",
      "contextHash": "f90441fe85fe676849a235e4db7e0af6f116b7cc763b6455c4609c54f5bcba2e"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-002",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "結構お気に入りの一曲。町の曲って無難になりやすくて、なかなか良曲にするのは難しいんですよね。",
      "sourceHash": "2e17748a9b5cb070da916b5e26ba0c27737f7b1405e75c88b425da10f9906c0d",
      "translation": "One of my favorites. Town themes tend to be fairly safe and conventional, so it's difficult to make a truly good one.",
      "contextHash": "2e17748a9b5cb070da916b5e26ba0c27737f7b1405e75c88b425da10f9906c0d"
    },
    {
      "id": "link-002",
      "type": "link",
      "source": "NR_town3.mp3（☆）",
      "sourceHash": "7816408a8002426bd1ae2007a1dffaa326bf411f428903276c6adbf824a47a97",
      "translation": "NR_town3.mp3 (☆) ",
      "contextHash": "0b7d4e1acf80e789a65c865fd7243db59b8aba47e490bfb717fb700a30a0ea58"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-003",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "砂漠の町。多少手抜きかもしれません。",
      "sourceHash": "66fec6faf56575f7a84bb4e0b1df30ad3346f47bd58a78a811d2614a8c3a07c6",
      "translation": "A desert town. I may have cut a few corners on this one.",
      "contextHash": "66fec6faf56575f7a84bb4e0b1df30ad3346f47bd58a78a811d2614a8c3a07c6"
    },
    {
      "id": "link-003",
      "type": "link",
      "source": "NR_town5.mp3（☆☆）",
      "sourceHash": "0d4cefb6c7a37f3ee4cb89a4e163badeb23ee03a9b6675d33caed244a1566084",
      "translation": "NR_town5.mp3 (☆☆) ",
      "contextHash": "836849db609f196846ae30f38371cdb0d4de5e08430984bbbe5ada14e3eaadbe"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-004",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ぐまっ！",
      "sourceHash": "842c8fdd69c109bccd0bc70855f2ebaa157157975c54ea5ca76e16cca1ba51e2",
      "translation": "Guma!",
      "contextHash": "842c8fdd69c109bccd0bc70855f2ebaa157157975c54ea5ca76e16cca1ba51e2"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-005",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "何かをもろパクリした気がします。たぶんロマサガ３の雪だるまの曲だと思うのですが……。改めて聞いたら、思ったよりは似てないですね。",
      "sourceHash": "f325e9083c1710fa3fbcb549cf1b5c30bc18fca162aa8bdc4c2bce004efe080d",
      "translation": "I feel like I blatantly copied something. I think it might be the snowman theme from Romancing SaGa 3... Listening to it again, though, it's not as similar as I thought.",
      "contextHash": "f325e9083c1710fa3fbcb549cf1b5c30bc18fca162aa8bdc4c2bce004efe080d"
    },
    {
      "id": "link-004",
      "type": "link",
      "source": "NR_village5.mp3（☆☆）",
      "sourceHash": "d893c13587469efc499de72ef733e0e94dcd558686af85aa91443da712467f42",
      "translation": "NR_village5.mp3 (☆☆) ",
      "contextHash": "fc1c96b7789ac82a99f3a7e5eac4ccc7daeb08863fc7e1d2d181c57168655d73"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-006",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "火の町。",
      "sourceHash": "733bc068149046702b84a79da70bb1f73500e2b9047eb6a81990dd498b7a87fd",
      "translation": "A town of fire.",
      "contextHash": "733bc068149046702b84a79da70bb1f73500e2b9047eb6a81990dd498b7a87fd"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-007",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "寂れた町のイメージで作ったのに、なぜか火の町で使われていました。",
      "sourceHash": "5e78eb55d09c8fc3ae858c6be1f0eea6bdece7c7e3ab6a2b0b1fa59c28b6c8be",
      "translation": "I made it with a run-down town in mind, but for some reason it ended up being used for a town of fire.",
      "contextHash": "5e78eb55d09c8fc3ae858c6be1f0eea6bdece7c7e3ab6a2b0b1fa59c28b6c8be"
    },
    {
      "id": "link-005",
      "type": "link",
      "source": "NR_village6.mp3（☆☆☆）",
      "sourceHash": "3d1b57497a86f339fa8ff0719d151bf0c5910732b58d0e1a8853fd0b7c6bc96a",
      "translation": "NR_village6.mp3 (☆☆☆) ",
      "contextHash": "a9b76d2480aed59986dcc43cafb3b50af154e87a9822b62abcc1373700b44ada"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-008",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "のどかな村。",
      "sourceHash": "02ebc6912fb63d3df0c56672fdb51b2cc88a24b983c1b5132bb6d43660fe4b8e",
      "translation": "An idyllic village.",
      "contextHash": "02ebc6912fb63d3df0c56672fdb51b2cc88a24b983c1b5132bb6d43660fe4b8e"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-009",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "南国っぽいイメージです。",
      "sourceHash": "91a6641462e6b8fb2e0867bcf9dbcdb8e7bd2da7c477b6c54940d4398b96cea5",
      "translation": "It has a tropical feel to it.",
      "contextHash": "91a6641462e6b8fb2e0867bcf9dbcdb8e7bd2da7c477b6c54940d4398b96cea5"
    },
    {
      "id": "link-006",
      "type": "link",
      "source": "NR_castle2.mp3（☆☆☆☆）",
      "sourceHash": "40d5c1edabb33121fd53f19d0daaa484ef1264bb69ce9affa2040492be50eee7",
      "translation": "NR_castle2.mp3 (☆☆☆☆) ",
      "contextHash": "d284c340123b34842addfbe8b4fadb64562580d76d5ff20f31e90f2db3cc3c0e"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-010",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "城。",
      "sourceHash": "615d82e20394e26b01cbb6dad5a6721b7881d3685ddee4480e1843df577d9b02",
      "translation": "A castle.",
      "contextHash": "615d82e20394e26b01cbb6dad5a6721b7881d3685ddee4480e1843df577d9b02"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-011",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "作りは単純ですが、悪くないと思います。長く聞いていても飽きにくいのではないかと。",
      "sourceHash": "549e1b82db19b8eeaa11f998e595f96577d205c98ec3424458b4f0ec69b722a0",
      "translation": "It's simple in structure, but I don't think it's bad. I think it's the kind of song you can listen to for a long time without getting tired of it.",
      "contextHash": "549e1b82db19b8eeaa11f998e595f96577d205c98ec3424458b4f0ec69b722a0"
    },
    {
      "id": "link-007",
      "type": "link",
      "source": "NR_brave1.mp3（☆☆）",
      "sourceHash": "cd5529f3acc0e340791c6f079f274764c02f9ffc00b4641cd522af7ad4fd3bb5",
      "translation": "NR_brave1.mp3 (☆☆) ",
      "contextHash": "64960f7654b65ba5601d684fbf09cfec7221cbdc0874436d672fccf5de9157f1"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-012",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "アジト。わりとしつこめな曲です。",
      "sourceHash": "495ffebbeca3c787d673c0ea035007715d9a9b09f8356cdf4ea4ffabc2e6a456",
      "translation": "A hideout. It's a fairly persistent tune.",
      "contextHash": "495ffebbeca3c787d673c0ea035007715d9a9b09f8356cdf4ea4ffabc2e6a456"
    },
    {
      "id": "link-008",
      "type": "link",
      "source": "NR_snow1.mp3（☆☆☆☆）",
      "sourceHash": "02819640b97b2f2fb982488ae7bfe2225e5948cea4b5de21ee5c2119873e8642",
      "translation": "NR_snow1.mp3 (☆☆☆☆) ",
      "contextHash": "b0dbc3c1df2266369a1ec73904e37ac69ff55c1ac66420336ad35c71ea1e8228"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-013",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ＲＰＧで雪の降る町に来た時のワクワク感は異常。",
      "sourceHash": "44c7e42fd5679e7e2b98ed5cedf1b5238ba086bb9d6a5a777e7d4599fc0bba1d",
      "translation": "The excitement of arriving in a snow-covered town in an RPG is something else.",
      "contextHash": "44c7e42fd5679e7e2b98ed5cedf1b5238ba086bb9d6a5a777e7d4599fc0bba1d"
    }
  ],
